# Unanchored, so it also catches guests/examples/*/target from the wasm builds.
target/

# The JS interpreter's artifacts are ~7 MiB each, and a rebuild writes a fresh
# pair, which is 14 MiB of blob per change to the guest, forever. heavy_init's
# dist is committed because it is under a megabyte; this one is not. Build it
# with `bash guests/build.sh`; the tests skip with a pointer when it is absent.
guests/interpreters/js/dist/
